title: Aruba Central: Access Point Uptime
agents: linux, windows
author: Kuhn & Rueß GmbH <info@kuhn-ruess.de>
license: GPL
distribution: none
description:
 Uptime of an Aruba access point. Aruba Central reports it as a string
 such as {15w 3d 15m}, which the check turns into seconds so a reboot is
 visible in the graph.

 The check has no parameters and is always OK.

perfdata:
 One value: the uptime in seconds.

inventory:
 One service per access point that reports an uptime.
